{{- /*
Deliberate exception to the "gate whole files via .chezmoiignore, not an
in-template if" rule: onepasswordRead shells out to `op`, and .chezmoiignore
filters the target *after* the template has already been rendered — it
can't stop that call from running on profiles without this vault item. The
in-template if is required here so the call is never evaluated on other
profiles, not just discarded. .chezmoiignore also excludes this target on
other profiles, for clarity and as a defense-in-depth backstop.
*/ -}}
{{- if eq .profile "personal" -}}
{{ onepasswordRead "op://Private/Wright Auto Server/public key" }}
{{ end -}}
